  "description": "Savaşçı (المحارب / The Warrior) is a 2017 Turkish military action drama following Turkey's elite Maroon Berets special forces unit — known as the Sword Team. After their commanders are unjustly arrested and imprisoned, the legendary unit faces disbandment. When they are finally freed, Colonel Halil Ibrahim and Captain Kağan Bozok must rebuild the team and return to the frontlines, carrying out high-stakes missions that test their courage, brotherhood, and love for their country across 5 seasons and 109 episodes.",
